{
  "//": "BREAKING AWAY (docs/BREAKAWAY.md). Reads war_of_independence, may_refuse_the_throne (each year); declared_independence, let_go_by_the_reach, independence_won, independence_lost, a_state_breaks_away, the_reach_is_partitioned, sedition_reported, house_won_over, reconquest_begun, rejoined_the_reach (deeds). What is decided is decided on the Senate screen's standing view. Joining a state and a second great war: a_house_joins_our_state, treaty_broken_by_accession, joined_a_state and camps_stirred (deeds); great_war_forgotten (a year).",
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "the_declaration",
      "tier": "situation",
      "weight": 70,
      "repeatable": true,
      "when": [
        {
          "type": "worldFlag",
          "flag": "declared_independence",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "read_it_in_every_square",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "adjustLegitimacy",
              "role": "self",
              "delta": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "adjustStress",
              "role": "self",
              "delta": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} had the declaration read aloud on every world that had gone with the house, on the same day. By evening there was no pretending it had not happened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "send_it_to_the_capital_first",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "adjustResource",
              "resource": "influence",
              "delta": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} sent the declaration to the capital before it was read at home, so that nobody there could say they had not been told to their faces."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "say_as_little_as_possible",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "adjustStress",
              "role": "self",
              "delta": -2
            },
            {
              "type": "log",
              "text": "{self.name} let the fact speak. The tithe stopped going to the capital, and the capital's writ stopped at the border. Nothing else was announced."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "they_let_you_go",
      "tier": "situation",
      "weight": 70,
      "repeatable": true,
      "when": [
        {
          "type": "worldFlag",
          "flag": "let_go_by_the_reach",
          "value": true
